&lt;p>The &lt;a href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/packet_transport/">Packet Transport Component&lt;/a> platform allows ESPHome nodes to directly communicate with each over a communication channel.
The UDP implementation of the platform uses UDP as a communication medium. See the &lt;a href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/packet_transport/">Packet Transport Component&lt;/a> and &lt;a href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/udp/">UDP Component&lt;/a> for more information.&lt;/p>
